<Base title="Privacy"><section class="content"><h1>Privacy</h1><p>Our first-release calculators work in your browser. Device-location permission is optional and is used to calculate prayer times or Qibla direction. We do not run analytics, marketing cookies or registration services in this version.</p><p>The Tasbih counter saves your tally in your browser's local storage. You can clear it at any time by clearing browser site data.</p><p>Our hosting provider may process technical request logs as needed to serve the website. This page must be reviewed and updated if additional services are added.</p></section></Base>